ext":"Write tests for evaluation/usage/export_flows.py to achieve at least 80% code coverage. Read the file to understand all the functions, then write a comprehensive test suite in evaluation/usage/test_export_flows.py. Use pytest with mocks for filesystem and mitmproxy dependencies. Focus on testing the pure logic functions with various inputs, edge cases, and error paths."}]}],"system":[{"type":"text","text":"x-anthropic-billing-header: cc_version=2.1.92.d68; cc_entrypoint=cli; cch=70f48;"},{"type":"text","text":"You are Claude Code, Anthropic's official CLI for Claude."},{"type":"text","text":"Generate a concise, sentence-case title (3-7 words) that captures the main topic or goal of this coding session. The title should be clear enough that the user recognizes the session in a list. Use sentence case: capitalize only the first word and proper nouns.\n\nReturn JSON with a single \"title\" field.\n\nGood examples:\n{\"title\": \"Fix login button on mobile\"}\n{\"title\": \"Add OAuth authentication\"}\n{\"title\": \"Debug failing CI tests\"}\n{\"title\": \"Refactor API client error handling\"}\n\nBad (too vague): {\"title\": \"Code changes\"}\nBad (too long): {\"title\": \"Investigate and fix the issue where the login button does not respond on mobile devices\"}\nBad (wrong case): {\"title\": \"Fix Login Button On Mobile\"}"}],"tools":[],"metadata":{"user_id":"{\"device_id\":\"cef938c98e4e1df904a1a9dd699f743737852ac12805bb3550d2e3b72f58288d\",\"account_uuid\":\"\",\"session_id\":\"5888dcd6-2f33-461a-b2d3-34b423ec659b\"}"},"max_tokens":32000,"temperature":1,"output_config":{"format":{"type":"json_schema","schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"title":{"type":"string"}},"required":["title"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"stream":true},7:headers;981:29:6:Accept,16:application/json,]31:13:Authorization,10:[REDACTED],]36:12:Content-Type,16:application/json,]51:10:User-Agent,33:claude-cli/2.1.92 (external, cli),]68:24:X-Claude-Code-Session-Id,36:5888dcd6-2f33-461a-b2d3-34b423ec659b,]28:16:X-Stainless-Arch,5:arm64,]25:16:X-Stainless-Lang,2:js,]26:14:X-Stainless-OS,5:Linux,]40:27:X-Stainless-Package-Version,6:0.80.0,]31:23:X-Stainless-Retry-Count,1:0,]30:19:X-Stainless-Runtime,4:node,]41:27:X-Stainless-Runtime-Version,7:v24.3.0,]29:19:X-Stainless-Timeout,3:600,]173:14:anthropic-beta,150:interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14,redact-thinking-2026-02-12,context-management-2025-06-27,prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05,structured-outputs-2025-12-15,]52:41:anthropic-dangerous-direct-browser-access,4:true,]35:17:anthropic-version,10:2023-06-01,]26:9:x-api-key,10:[REDACTED],]14:5:x-app,3:cli,]28:10:Connection,10:keep-alive,]28:4:Host,17:api.anthropic.com,]46:15:Accept-Encoding,23:gzip, deflate, br, zstd,]25:14:Content-Length,4:1859,]]12:http_version;8:HTTP/1.1,}6:backup;0:~17:timestamp_created;18:1775474748.6204982^7:comment;0:;8:metadata;0:}6:marked;0:;9:is_replay;0:~11:intercepted;5:false!11:server_conn;4100:3:via;0:~19:timestamp_tcp_setup;18:1775474748.6508372^7:address;27:17:api.anthropic.com;3:443#]19:timestamp_tls_setup;18:1775474748.6841986^13:timestamp_end;0:~15:timestamp_start;17:1775474748.621776^3:sni;17:api.anthropic.com;11:tls_version;7:TLSv1.3;11:cipher_list;0:]6:cipher;22:TLS_AES_256_GCM_SHA384;11:alpn_offers;0:]4:alpn;0:,16:certificate_list;3569:1318:-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----
